</jpcrp_cor:NotesShareOptionsEtcConsolidatedFinancialStatementsTextBlock>
  <jpcrp_cor:NotesTaxEffectAccountingConsolidatedFinancialStatementsTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearDuration">
&lt;h6&gt;（税効果会計関係）&lt;/h6&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 72px; text-align: left; text-indent: -12px"&gt;１．繰延税金資産及び繰延税金負債の発生の主な原因別の内訳&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div style="margin-left: 72px"&gt;
&lt;table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="table-layout: fixed; width: 560px"&gt;
&lt;colgroup&gt;
&lt;col style="width: 288px"/&gt;
